 # Changelog (newest first). Dates are the assistant's sandbox dates.
+
+## Unreleased - Server Dashboard: live monitoring and no-CLI administration
+- **Server (`server/`)**: new `monitor.js` and admin endpoints - `GET /api/admin/metrics` (uptime, requests/min, errors, response time, memory/CPU, sessions, storage and disk space, backup age, certificate expiry, health alerts, 1-hour time series), `GET /api/admin/sessions` + `POST .../sessions/revoke` + `POST .../users/<u>/signout`, `GET /api/admin/files` (browse/filter/summary) + `GET|POST .../files/verify` (SHA-256 integrity check of every stored file), `GET /api/admin/backups` + `POST .../backups/verify`, `GET|POST /api/admin/config` (validated, applied LIVE and persisted; no restart needed), `GET /api/admin/logs`, `POST /api/admin/restart` (graceful exit; `run-server.cmd` starts it again), `GET /api/setup/state` + `POST /api/setup/owner` (create the first administrator from the server PC only, while none exists).
+- **Fixed**: the "sessions" figure counted sessions that were idle for over 30 minutes; it now counts only live sessions.
+- **Dashboard app (`server-dashboard/`)**: live Overview (alerts, tiles, four charts, storage/backup/security/WADA panels, refresh 5/10/30 s or paused), new *Connected users* and *Stored files* screens, first-time setup dialog, forgot-password recovery (server PC, run as administrator), **remote mode** (connect from any PC with the server address + `ca.crt`; fingerprint shown), restart without Windows elevation, live log follow, session-expiry handling.
+- **Fixed in the dashboard**: users with the *audit* permission (e.g. Quality) could open the Audit screen but every request was refused; the username `pattern` was an invalid regular expression in Chrome 134 (validation silently off); polling spawned `schtasks` + `node` every 10 s (now every 30 s) and re-showed the same error repeatedly; after the session expired the dashboard looped on errors instead of asking to sign in.
+- Tests: `tests/server/admin-dashboard.test.js` (8) and `tests/dashboard/e2e.test.js` (21; real renderer in headless Chromium + real `main.js` handlers + real HTTPS server; skipped when playwright/openssl are missing).
 Builds 1.0.10 to 1.0.13 were delivered as downloads and then **replaced** (not retained). The only older package that still exists is the lab's own v1.0.9 portable zip (the Electron runtime base). Sources of 1.0.10-1.0.13 are contained in the history below only as described, not as separate archives.
 
 ## Checkpoint 3 - central LAN server (no change to the desktop app) - 2026-11-03
